Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:30.96,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1937.334,548)}♥本视频在Enderman频道会员有效期内翻译♥
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.91,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在本视频中 我想展示另一个虚假验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.91,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,In this video, I want to show you another fake CAPTCHA,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.15,0:00:12.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这次有所不同
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.15,0:00:12.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but this time with a twist.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,链接就在这里
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've got the link here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.05,0:00:17.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个域名显然不可信
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.05,0:00:17.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The domain is definitely not plausible,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.69,0:00:21.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过你们大概能猜到后续剧情
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.69,0:00:21.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but you can probably tell where it is going already.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.27,0:00:26.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们验证下猜想
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.27,0:00:26.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And let's confirm the suspicions.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.49,0:00:31.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为首先
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.49,0:00:31.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Because first of all,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.17,0:00:33.75,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们遇到的是Cloudflare的真实验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.17,0:00:33.75,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,we get a real CAPTCHA by Cloudflare.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.67,0:00:37.45,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你可能会以为这就是
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.67,0:00:37.45,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And you would think it's that beautiful,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.79,0:00:40.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我一直在寻找的那个完美模仿Cloudflare
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.79,0:00:40.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,fake Cloudflare CAPTCHA that I was looking for.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.07,0:00:46.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但实际上你会被重定向到虚假YouTube页面
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.07,0:00:46.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,However, you actually get redirected to a fake YouTube page.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.47,0:00:50.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,注意看 在继续访问YouTube前
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.47,0:00:50.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And let's see, before you continue to YouTube,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,需要点击这个看似可信的reCAPTCHA验证
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,click on this pretty plausible-looking reCAPTCHA.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.37,0:00:58.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看这里
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.37,0:00:58.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So, look at this.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“确认您不是机器人”
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Confirm you're not a bot.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.35,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你甚至可以滚动页面
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.35,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You can actually scroll and everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.49,0:01:07.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在外行人眼里几乎以假乱真
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.49,0:01:07.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It looks pretty fine to an untrained eye.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们点击这个复选框试试
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's try clicking on that checkbox.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.27,0:01:16.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“完成以下验证步骤”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.27,0:01:16.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Complete these verification steps.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“为确认您非机器人”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,To confirm you're not a robot,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.43,0:01:19.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“请按步骤操作”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.43,0:01:19.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,please follow these steps.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.07,0:01:23.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“在验证窗口中按住Windows键加R键”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.07,0:01:23.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Press and hold the Windows key plus R In the verification window,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.65,0:01:26.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“按Control加V粘贴复制的数据”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.65,0:01:26.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,press Control plus V to paste the copied data.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.55,0:01:27.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“按Enter键完成验证”
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.55,0:01:27.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Press Enter to complete the verification.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.93,0:01:31.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 这就是经典的虚假验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.93,0:01:31.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, this is the classic fake CAPTCHA.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.11,0:01:36.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这类验证码相当罕见
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.11,0:01:36.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,These CAPTCHAs are pretty rare,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.53,0:01:39.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为我见过的那些做工都很粗糙
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.53,0:01:39.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because the ones I have visited weren't super well made.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.95,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,来看看它要我们执行什么操作
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.95,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's see what it's asking us to execute.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.57,0:01:47.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,首先 我们获取到的是PowerShell命令
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.57,0:01:47.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,First of all, we get the PowerShell command,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.65,0:01:48.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,也就是PowerShell脚本
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.65,0:01:48.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the PowerShell script.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.59,0:01:51.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这和我上期视频预期的一致
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.59,0:01:51.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And that's what I expected in the last video,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.49,0:01:54.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当时实际运行的是MSHTA程序
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.49,0:01:54.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,when it actually ran MSHTA.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.57,0:01:56.95,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这条指令的作用是...
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.57,0:01:56.95,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the command is...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.95,0:01:58.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,执行一个HTA文件
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.95,0:01:58.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It runs an HTA file.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.45,0:02:04.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它向这个bookvrff.com网站发起网络请求
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.45,0:02:04.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It invokes the web request to this website here,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.87,0:02:10.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,将内容保存为文件后通过MSHTA运行
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.87,0:02:10.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,bookvrff.com, saves it to the file,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.55,0:02:15.21,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,之所以用MSHTA执行命令
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.55,0:02:15.21,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and then runs it via MSHTA.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.44,0:02:22.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是因为MSHTA存在大量漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.44,0:02:22.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs95}And the idea why it runs the command via MSHTA is because MSHTA is very vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:27.58,Newman-CN-4K,注释,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(2044,1212)\fad(200,200)}MSHTA同样是一种已知的lolbin\N（活体二进制文件，英文全称：Living-Off-the-Land Binaries\N直译为：生活在陆地上的二进制，白名单文件利用技术），\N常被恶意软件用作间接层以模仿可信行为
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.39,0:02:25.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可利用多种漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.39,0:02:25.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And there are a lot of holes,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.89,0:02:31.65,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,突破HTA沙箱限制
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.89,0:02:31.65,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,a lot of exploits you can employ to break out of the HTA box.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在来看看这个网站有什么猫腻
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's see what that website has to offer.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,复制bookvrff.com网址
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's copy the bookvrff.com,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.03,0:02:43.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,查看网站内容
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.03,0:02:43.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,see what it has on the website.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.49,0:02:50.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,显示该站点已被微软Defender SmartScreen标记为不安全
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.49,0:02:47.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, so first of all, we get this site has been reported
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:50.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,as unsafe by Microsoft Defender SmartScreen.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.37,0:02:54.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 早就被举报滥用
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.37,0:02:54.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's already been abuse reported.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.51,0:02:58.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,无视风险，继续访问
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.51,0:02:58.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's continue to the unsafe site,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,却显示服务不可用
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and we get service unavailable.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.73,0:03:01.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.73,0:03:01.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.01,0:03:04.45,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但实际执行这条命令会发生什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.01,0:03:04.45,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But what happens when we actually run this command?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们来试试
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's try that out.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.97,0:03:11.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,为此需要打开命令提示符
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.97,0:03:11.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run the command prompt for that.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.09,0:03:12.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,准备就绪
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.09,0:03:12.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我将以管理员身份运行
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run this as an admin.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后...
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.61,0:03:20.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,啊 剪贴板历史没开启
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.61,0:03:20.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have clipboard history.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.87,0:03:21.25,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.87,0:03:21.25,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,马上粘贴看看效果
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's paste that real quick and see what happens.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.93,0:03:33.97,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,应用程序工具
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.93,0:03:33.97,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Application tool.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.97,0:03:38.77,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后它会执行另外几个PowerShell脚本
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.97,0:03:38.77,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Then it executes a couple other PowerShell scripts,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.41,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.41,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it seems like.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.83,0:03:43.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我来检查任务管理器
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.83,0:03:43.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's check the task manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.59,0:03:44.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,正在写入网络请求
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.59,0:03:44.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Writing web requests.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.39,0:03:45.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它一直在下载东西
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.39,0:03:45.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It keeps downloading stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.03,0:03:49.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这里可能经过了几层间接跳转
Dialogue: 2,0:03:47.03,0:03:49.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There might be a couple indirections here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.15,0:03:56.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以当你看到PowerShell脚本在某个应用程序工具窗口弹出时
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.15,0:03:56.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So once you see PowerShell scripts popping up in some application tool window,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.89,0:03:58.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是个危险信号
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.89,0:03:58.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it is a bad sign.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最搞笑的是
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And the funniest part,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.45,0:04:04.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我觉得 它实际上受到Cloudflare的保护
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.45,0:04:04.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think, is that it's actually protected by Cloudflare,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.35,0:04:06.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而且开头还设置了真正的验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.35,0:04:06.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and they have the real CAPTCHA at the beginning.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.75,0:04:09.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,等等 现在好像失效了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.75,0:04:09.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, it doesn't work anymore,
