Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's see what this file is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,能让我保留它吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Can I please keep it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.53,0:05:13.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,检测到病毒
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.53,0:05:13.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Virus detected.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.39,0:05:14.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.39,0:05:14.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.23,0:05:17.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,X蠕虫病毒
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.23,0:05:17.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,XWorm.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.91,0:05:19.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我想看看这个文件
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.91,0:05:19.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I want to see this file.
