Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It was deleted by that script.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.08,0:07:35.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我有个每次开机都会运行的exe文件
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.08,0:07:35.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I have an exe file that runs on every computer startup,
