Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.06,0:07:38.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it surely does nothing good.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.30,0:07:44.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是运行一个来自假YouTube页面的不明命令的下场
Dialogue: 2,0:07:39.30,0:07:42.21,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So this is what happens when you run an executable served
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,to you by a fake YouTube capture.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.42,0:07:47.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,别成为这种骗局的受害者
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.42,0:07:47.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Don't fall victim to such a scam,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感谢观看
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and thank you for watching.
