Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's running in the background,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Launs.exe看 正在运行
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Launs.exe, see, it's running.
